  unitName: Horseman Jack (EU)
  unitId: 710015
  unitNumber: 7002
  description: Without a conscience, eternal wanderer, riding aimlessly, forever
    alone... The headless horseman has become legend. A legendary storyteller traveling
    throughout Grand Gaia spread the story of the dreadful rider. The legends men
    believe in, whose names they whisper when night falls, need an ending... and
    if these men have a heart, the ending can be happy. The power of the stories
    told during the festival of the dead brought back the old custom of offering
    a piece of burning coal to the horseman. An eternity passed, and the horseman
    was not the only one rejected from heaven and hell. Today, lost have a benevolent
    guardian, and the souls mate he never found during his lifetime is now at this
    side. What striking similarity to the legendary storyteller who spread his story!
  summonDesc: The legend is just beginning.
  fusionDesc: The souls of the lost are the source of my power.
  evoDesc: The lost souls will be an inexhaustible source of power.
  element: 1
  rarity: 5
